{"id":"fcd2a2bd1b358916","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-friedberg-muchnik-construction.md","title":"Friedberg-Muchnik Construction","display":"thm-friedberg-muchnik-construction — Friedberg-Muchnik Construction","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-friedberg-muchnik-construction","aliases":["68-thm-friedberg-muchnik-construction"],"display":"thm-friedberg-muchnik-construction — Friedberg-Muchnik Construction","depends_on":["[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","[[68-df-turing-reducibility]]","[[68-df-finite-computation-approximation]]","[[68-df-oracle-computation]]","[[68-thm-oracle-finite-use]]","[[68-df-friedberg-muchnik-stages]]","[[68-df-recursive-function]]","[[68-df-finite-injury]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"15.5 pp.57-58 / PDF66-67; set-level construction extracted","verification_status":"local-explicit-construction-reviewed","source_proof_status":"local-mathematical-verification; no-proof-assistant-certificate","revision_basis":"supplied-68(2).zip; local scope, domain, and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-friedberg-muchnik-construction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-friedberg-muchnik-construction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-friedberg-muchnik-construction — Friedberg-Muchnik Construction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"913d52943499d039\" href=\"?note=913d52943499d039\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7ed23faee951231d\" href=\"?note=7ed23faee951231d\" title=\"68-df-turing-reducibility\">68-df-turing-reducibility</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dad7e17cfa2772ae\" href=\"?note=dad7e17cfa2772ae\" title=\"68-df-finite-computation-approximation\">68-df-finite-computation-approximation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"124259d2584af1b6\" href=\"?note=124259d2584af1b6\" title=\"68-df-oracle-computation\">68-df-oracle-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3602b7d0a6be1b32\" href=\"?note=3602b7d0a6be1b32\" title=\"68-thm-oracle-finite-use\">68-thm-oracle-finite-use</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f056ea86f9505c97\" href=\"?note=f056ea86f9505c97\" title=\"68-df-friedberg-muchnik-stages\">68-df-friedberg-muchnik-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a82d826d433dcff3\" href=\"?note=a82d826d433dcff3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-function\">68-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"75703316b975a2ec\" href=\"?note=75703316b975a2ec\" title=\"68-df-finite-injury\">68-df-finite-injury</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"15.5 pp.57-58 / PDF66-67; set-level construction extracted"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-explicit-construction-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"local-mathematical-verification; no-proof-assistant-certificate"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68(2).zip; local scope, domain, and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f056ea86f9505c97\" href=\"?note=f056ea86f9505c97\" title=\"68-df-friedberg-muchnik-stages\">68-df-friedberg-muchnik-stages</a> 唯一确定的阶段数据 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_s\">\\(C_s\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FMAct}\">\\(\\mathrm{FMAct}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_{\\mathrm{FM}},\\beta_{\\mathrm{FM}},\\gamma_{\\mathrm{FM}}\">\\(\\alpha_{\\mathrm{FM}},\\beta_{\\mathrm{FM}},\\gamma_{\\mathrm{FM}}\\)</span> 及极限集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{\\mathrm{FM}},B_{\\mathrm{FM}}\">\\(A_{\\mathrm{FM}},B_{\\mathrm{FM}}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"a82d826d433dcff3\" href=\"?note=a82d826d433dcff3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-function\">68-df-recursive-function</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinInjury}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinInjury}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"75703316b975a2ec\" href=\"?note=75703316b975a2ec\" title=\"68-df-finite-injury\">68-df-finite-injury</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_T\">\\(\\le_T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^D\">\\(\\Phi_e^D\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"913d52943499d039\" href=\"?note=913d52943499d039\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-set</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"7ed23faee951231d\" href=\"?note=7ed23faee951231d\" title=\"68-df-turing-reducibility\">68-df-turing-reducibility</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"124259d2584af1b6\" href=\"?note=124259d2584af1b6\" title=\"68-df-oracle-computation\">68-df-oracle-computation</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_D\">\\(\\chi_D\\)</span> 沿用该 oracle 接口的集合表示函数。有限查询保持使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"3602b7d0a6be1b32\" href=\"?note=3602b7d0a6be1b32\" title=\"68-thm-oracle-finite-use\">68-thm-oracle-finite-use</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_{\\mathrm{FM}}\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N^2},\\qquad\n\\beta_{\\mathrm{FM}}\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N^2},\\qquad\n\\gamma_{\\mathrm{FM}}\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha_{\\mathrm{FM}}\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N^2},\\qquad\n\\beta_{\\mathrm{FM}}\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N^2},\\qquad\n\\gamma_{\\mathrm{FM}}\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(C_s(0)\\subseteq C_{s+1}(0)\\land C_s(1)\\subseteq C_{s+1}(1)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(C_s(0)\\subseteq C_{s+1}(0)\\land C_s(1)\\subseteq C_{s+1}(1)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(s\\ge s_0\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{FMAct}(i,s)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(s\\ge s_0\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{FMAct}(i,s)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinInjury}(\\gamma_{\\mathrm{FM}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FinInjury}(\\gamma_{\\mathrm{FM}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\Phi_e^{B_{\\mathrm{FM}}}\\ne\\chi_{A_{\\mathrm{FM}}}\\land\\Phi_e^{A_{\\mathrm{FM}}}\\ne\\chi_{B_{\\mathrm{FM}}}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\Phi_e^{B_{\\mathrm{FM}}}\\ne\\chi_{A_{\\mathrm{FM}}}\\land\\Phi_e^{A_{\\mathrm{FM}}}\\ne\\chi_{B_{\\mathrm{FM}}}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_{\\mathrm{FM}},B_{\\mathrm{FM}}\\in\\mathrm{RE},\\qquad A_{\\mathrm{FM}}\\nleq_T B_{\\mathrm{FM}}\\land B_{\\mathrm{FM}}\\nleq_T A_{\\mathrm{FM}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_{\\mathrm{FM}},B_{\\mathrm{FM}}\\in\\mathrm{RE},\\qquad A_{\\mathrm{FM}}\\nleq_T B_{\\mathrm{FM}}\\land B_{\\mathrm{FM}}\\nleq_T A_{\\mathrm{FM}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists A\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\;(A\\nleq_T B\\land B\\nleq_T A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists A\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\;(A\\nleq_T B\\land B\\nleq_T A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原包记录的集合存在性结论对应 15.5；本次把其 Remark 中的有限伤害安排落实为直接依赖文件中的确定性递归，而不声称阶段编号与原书逐数一致。这里不再通过一段自然语言算法来隐式定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{\\mathrm{FM}}\">\\(A_{\\mathrm{FM}}\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_{\\mathrm{FM}}\">\\(B_{\\mathrm{FM}}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>阶段有效性：初态为有限数据；见证分配是有限递归，候选行动集用已定义的有界 oracle 图判定，实际限制由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_s\">\\(u_s\\)</span> 计算。各阶段 oracle 是前一状态的有限集合。有限数据上的这些运算可由基本机器执行，故三个数值阶段函数全递归。两列有限集合单调，其并为 RE。</p>\n<p>对策略编号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 归纳。较高策略全部停止行动后，策略 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 不再被初始化；至迟下一阶段获得固定见证，并且由于行动后 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d=1\">\\(d=1\\)</span>，此后至多行动一次。故每个策略只行动有限次，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma_{\\mathrm{FM}}\">\\(\\gamma_{\\mathrm{FM}}\\)</span> 的较高行动伤害也有限。</p>\n<p>固定策略 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 的最后见证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>。若它行动，就在自身目标集合枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，同时记录对方 oracle 的真实查询界；较低策略已经初始化，其新见证全部高于该界，较高策略不再行动，所以输出 0 的对方计算永远保持。自身表示函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 为 1，完成对角化。若它不行动，全局不重复的见证分配保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 永不由其他策略枚举，故自身表示函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 为 0。若极限 oracle 计算在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 输出 0，则有限查询稳定后，在足够大的阶段必进入候选集；此时没有较高策略再行动，最小编号选择迫使本策略行动，矛盾。其余情况是发散或非零输出，同样不同于自身在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的值。</p>\n<p>因此全部对角要求成立，两个明确给出的极限集合互不图灵归约。以上是对本地阶段递归的数学验证，不是证明助手证书；原包的书籍页码记录未在本次重新核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"913d52943499d039","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-turing-reducibility","status":"resolved","id":"7ed23faee951231d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-turing-reducibility]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-finite-computation-approximation","status":"resolved","id":"dad7e17cfa2772ae","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-finite-computation-approximation]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"124259d2584af1b6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depend